            <ArticleTitle>[The place of vascular pathology among suicide risk factors].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>104-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A study was made of the structure and intensity of vascular pathology in persons with completed suicides. The relation of that pathology to other risk factors was established as was the correlation between vascular pathology in different organs together with its role as a risk factor of suicides. Based on the data obtained, the system of medicosocial security of elderly patients is proposed in order to prevent suicides.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
